### Default greeting
GET http://localhost:8080/api/hello
Accept: application/json

### Greeting by query parameter
GET http://localhost:8080/api/hello?name=Alice1

### Greeting by path variable
GET http://localhost:8080/api/hello/Alice2

### Greeting by JSON body
POST http://localhost:8080/api/hello
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Alice3"
}
